{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52183","headline":"颂六十二首 八 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禁饕缘芳味，持声唯节俭。\n一坐肃容仪，五万丰余歛。\n戒香飞且馥，情关闭愈（一作「逾」）掩。\n勿言徒辛苦，终然越危嶮。\n（见同书卷六《受斋部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52183.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52183","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}